## Odometer and fuel at pickup and return

When you check the car in or out yourself:

1. Add a photo of the dashboard (the odometer and the fuel gauge). It can come from your camera roll. We read it and ask, for example, "Odometer 45,210 km, fuel 3/4: correct?". Press **Yes, correct**, or **No, I will type it** and type the odometer and pick the fuel level.
2. Take a selfie in front of the car with your camera.

After the return, **Your return: km and fuel** on your booking shows the km driven, the km included and any km over, the fuel compared with pickup, and the charge for each. The photo report shows both dashboard photos.',
  '<p class="gd-p">We check the car with you at the return. Your deposit balance comes back, and your receipts and agreement stay in your portal.</p><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-the-return-and-your-deposit" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The return and your deposit</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>At the return we check the odometer, fuel or charge, keys and cleanliness, take photos and compare with pickup. You sign on our screen.</li><li>The photo report of the pickup and the return is in your email, in Documents and on your booking (<b class="gd-ui">Photo report</b>): the times, the kilometres, the fuel, every photo and any damage. A late return, kilometres over the allowance or less fuel than at pickup are charged from these readings.</li><li>We release the deposit balance after you return the car. If a toll, ticket or claim is still open, we may hold back what we expect it to cost for a while.</li><li>Your statement appears under Documents.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-review-your-trip" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Review your trip</h2><p class="gd-p">After the return we send you a link by email or text. It takes about a minute, and we help you write it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the link. Tap what you liked: the car, the pickup or delivery, communication, the price, cleanliness, how easy booking was, or the name of the person who helped you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">If you like, tap the stars for how it felt, and write one sentence in your own words.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your review appears, made only from what you picked and wrote and the facts of your booking. Change anything you like.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Post on Google</b>: it copies your review and opens Google. Choose your stars and paste it. <b class="gd-ui">Copy</b> only copies it.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Already left a review? Press &quot;I already left a review&quot; and we stop asking. Something wasn&#39;t right? The page offers to tell us directly. We never offer anything for a review, and every renter gets the same link.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-review-your-rental-on-our-site" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Review your rental on our site</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the trip under Past trips, then press <b class="gd-ui">Review your rental</b>. Liked the car? <b class="gd-ui">Book again</b> opens it for new dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Tap the stars. Add a title and a few words if you like. Both are optional.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Tick <b class="gd-ui">Show my review on the site with my first name</b> only if you agree to it being shown.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send my review</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10004/review</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/672"><img src="/guides/img/renter-14-review-desktop-c6c61830.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="672"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:25%;top:33.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.5%;top:84.5%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:18.1%;top:92.4%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-documents-and-your-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Documents and your account</h2><p class="gd-p">The menu has four links: <b class="gd-ui">Trips</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Documents</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Account</b>.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Documents</b>: your agreements, receipts, statements and uploads. Press <b class="gd-ui">View</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Download</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>: your contact details (<b class="gd-ui">Save</b>), sign-in, drivers and your Card on File.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Notifications</b>: notices from us. Use <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>, and choose which optional emails you get. A number on <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> in the menu is how many notices you have not read.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/documents</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/560"><img src="/guides/img/renter-15-documents-desktop-fd428a63.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="560"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.8%;top:35.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Your legal name is locked once you are verified. To change it, call or message us. To change your email, open Profile, Sign-in and press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b>: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and the email changes when the link is opened.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-sign-in-with-your-phone-number" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign in with your phone number</h2><p class="gd-p">No password needed: we text you a 6-digit code from the CarmaCars number.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span>, press <b class="gd-ui">Use my phone number instead</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Enter your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Text me a code</b>. Codes go to Canadian mobile numbers.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the 6-digit code from the text (on most phones it fills itself in), or press <b class="gd-ui">Sign in</b>. The code works for 5 minutes; <b class="gd-ui">Send a new code</b> after a minute if it did not arrive.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">To sign in by phone every time, open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Add and verify my phone number</b>, enter the code we text you, then choose <b class="gd-ui">My phone number (a code by text)</b> under Sign in with. The sign-in page then opens on your phone number.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>New here? On Create account, press Sign up with my phone number instead: your name, your mobile number and the code. An account made by phone has no email yet: you can send requests, accept offers and sign, and the pay page asks for your email before your first payment, for the receipts. A booking request you sent earlier with the same mobile number is added to your account once the code is checked.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-texts-or-email-how-we-reach-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email: how we reach you</h2><p class="gd-p">Choose Email, Text or Both. Texts are short, come from the CarmaCars number and link to the page.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>. It is saved at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Texts go to the phone you verified with a code (Sign-in, above). Until you verify one, we email you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Signed agreements, statements and receipts are always emailed when we have your email. On Text you also get a text with a link to view or download them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">No texts from 9 pm to 8 am, except urgent ones such as a late return. Reply STOP to any text to stop texts (we confirm with one text); text START to turn them back on.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You can also choose in the booking request (How should we reach you?) and when you sign up with your phone number, where Text is chosen for you.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-rewards" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Rewards</h2><p class="gd-p">Open <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b> in your account.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Every rental earns 1 point per dollar of the rental charge when it closes. 100 points are worth $1 off the rental charge of a later booking.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">More ways to earn are listed on the page: refer a friend with your link (you both get points at their first rental), follow us, review your rental on carmacars.ca, review us on Google (press <b class="gd-ui">I posted my review</b> and give the name on it), a damage-free rental, your birthday and your first rental.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Get my code</b> turns points into a code of your own, from 500 points. Type it in the promo code box of your request. An unused code can be given back for the points.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Rent 10 days in 12 months for Silver (5% off) and 30 for Gold (10% off): your tier code is on the page.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Points end 12 months after your last rental or redemption. We email you a month before.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-your-trip-in-your-calendar-or-wallet" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your trip in your calendar or wallet</h2><p class="gd-p">On a confirmed booking, <b class="gd-ui">Add to calendar</b> adds the pickup and the return. The confirmation email has the same link. <b class="gd-ui">Add to Apple Wallet</b> shows when it is available.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when your offer is ready, before pickup and return, for payments and when we message you, even with CarmaCars closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, untick anything you do not want. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> to see one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first: in Safari tap <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. Open CarmaCars from your Home Screen, sign in and turn alerts on in Profile (iOS 16.4 or later).</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Alerts come as well as your emails and texts, never instead of them. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am. Sign-in links and codes never come as alerts.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> and scroll to <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, add a reason if you like, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">We settle anything still open (a rental, a deposit), delete your account and email you within 30 days. Changed your mind before then? Press <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>We keep rental agreements, receipts and tax records as the law requires. Everything else, including your licence and selfie photos, is deleted.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-odometer-and-fuel-at-pickup-and-return" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Odometer and fuel at pickup and return</h2><p class="gd-p">When you check the car in or out yourself:</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Add a photo of the dashboard (the odometer and the fuel gauge). It can come from your camera roll. We read it and ask, for example, &quot;Odometer 45,210 km, fuel 3/4: correct?&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Yes, correct</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">No, I will type it</b> and type the odometer and pick the fuel level.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take a selfie in front of the car with your camera.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">After the return, <b class="gd-ui">Your return: km and fuel</b> on your booking shows the km driven, the km included and any km over, the fuel compared with pickup, and the charge for each. The photo report shows both dashboard photos.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'apply-and-get-your-car-listed', 'chapter', 'start-here', 'You apply online in about ten minutes. We reply within one business day, set your terms, and walk you through the rest.

## Apply to list your car

1. Go to `carmacars.ca/list-your-car` and press **Apply to list your car**.
2. Start with your name, mobile and email, and your car: its VIN, or its year, make and model. Press **Continue**. From here every answer is saved as you type.
3. About you: individual or corporation, your address, licence and date of birth. Press **Continue to vehicles**.
4. For each car, type the VIN: your car is found as you type the last character (Edit if anything is wrong), then tap its colour and answer the rest. Signed in? Press **Take a photo** under Fill this from the ownership permit: the VIN, plate and colour fill in from a photo of your Ontario permit, for you to check. Use **Add another vehicle** for more cars.
5. Read how it will work, press **Continue**, then **Review**.
6. Press **Submit application**, then **Go to your owner portal**.

![](/guides/img/public-13-list-your-car-desktop-48bf4cb0.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 800; address: carmacars.ca/list-your-car; pins: 1 20.1 74.9")

> Tip: Need a break? Your answers are already saved. **Email me a link** sends you a link to finish later, on any device. If you stop part way, we may email you a link to finish too.

> Good to know: No car to add yet? On the vehicle step press **I''ll add my car later**, choose your password and press **Open my owner account**. Your owner portal opens with **Add your first car**: press it when you are ready, starting with the VIN.

## What happens next

Five steps take your car from your driveway to its first rental.

:::flow
Tell us about the car | We confirm fees and set your terms
Sign the agreements | Online, one for all your cars
One registry visit | We fill in the forms and come with you
Tracker and insurance | We install it and add the car
Photos and listing | Live within 1 business day
:::

1. Right after you apply, Home shows **Read your agreements**: both agreements, filled in from your application, marked "Terms pending approval". The fees and the Revenue Share read Pending approval until we set them, and the Sign button stays off.
2. When your terms are ready, Home shows **Check and sign**. Everything is filled in from your application: check the short list of key values (each has a **Fix** link) and open any document to read it in full.
3. Sign in a few steps: say you read the documents, initial the three confirmations, tick the two consents and draw your signature. Then press **Sign all**. A code to your phone or email is optional (**Verify by code**); it is asked first only if CarmaCars turns it on. One signature covers every document, in about two minutes.
4. Pay the upfront invoice: the first and last month''s insurance fee for each car (see chapter 4).
5. Upload what each car''s checklist asks for: the ownership permit, the lender''s permission if it is financed or leased, and insurance.
6. Sign Forms C and D (filled in for you) on screen, with your witnesses beside you on the same device: Form C with one witness, Form D with two (see chapter 5).

## If we need a little more

Sometimes we need one more document before we can approve your application, for example the ownership permit or the insurance slip.

1. You get an email, and Home shows "We need a little more" with the list and any note from our team.
2. Upload what is asked, or write Your answer, and press **Send my answer**.
3. We review it within 1 business day. Once we approve your application, you get an email and Home shows Check and sign.

No typing the VIN: press **Scan the barcode** and point your phone at the barcode in the driver''s door frame or at the bottom of the windshield, or **Photo of the VIN** and take a photo of it. Check the VIN shown before you continue.

**Photos:** on your car''s page, **Add photos** takes any number at once, in any order. We sort them, put the outside photos on our studio background and touch up the inside ones. Photos that fit no shot go in with **Extra outside photos** or **Extra inside and detail photos**. At least 10 are needed.

## A fleet supplier: lease your cars to CarmaCars

For a corporation that leases its cars to CarmaCars for a fixed amount a month. You pay CarmaCars no fees: no invoices, no debits.

1. Go to `carmacars.ca/list-your-car` and press **A corporation with a fleet? Lease your cars to us as a fleet supplier** (or choose **A corporation** in the application, then **Fleet supplier: lease your cars to CarmaCars**).
2. About you: the corporation''s legal name and number, its registered address, and the signing officer''s name and title.
3. For each car: type the VIN (the year, make and model fill in), then the plate, and mark the car **Regular** or **Troubled** (it needs work). Each tier shows its lease a month. The tier is set when you add the car and does not change.
4. Say who the car is registered to now: **My corporation**, **Me or another officer, personally** (it moves into your corporation), or **A seller: the corporation is buying it**. For the last two, enter the name and address on the ownership and the transfer or sale date.
5. Press **Continue**, check the review and press **Submit application**. The ServiceOntario forms each car needs are filled in for you at once, under **Documents**: the lease to CarmaCars (CarmaCars holds the plates while it leases the car) and, for a car not yet registered to your corporation, the transfer into it. A seller signs the transfer on the back of the ownership. Only the empty boxes are filled; you sign them in ink at ServiceOntario.
6. In your owner portal, open **Cars**, then each car, and upload its ownership (registration) copy.
7. We check each car. Once we approve it, it is on the lease at its tier and Home shows **Check and sign**: you sign the Fleet Supplier Lease Agreement, the Title-Holding and Lease Agreement and Form B (the lease summary) in the owner portal, on screen (there is no paper option). Form D (the limited power of attorney) is in your Documents too: you sign it on screen with two witnesses beside you, and CarmaCars signs its Part 2 at the same moment.

> Good to know: Home and **Money** show **Your fleet lease**: each car, its tier, its lease a month and the next payment date. The lease is paid on the 10th for the month before, with your statement; the first payment comes at least one full month after the car goes on the lease, and part months are paid by the day. Add more cars from your owner portal the same way.', 'Apply and get your car listed', 'Apply online, sign, pay the upfront invoice and get your car on the site.',
